  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi Donor Trust Fund for Support to the Comprehensive African Agricultural Development Program (CAADP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programmatic Trust Fund will support capacity building and  activities of African institutions to lead the adoption and  utilization across the Continent of the AU/NEPAD&apos;s Comprehensive  Africa Agriculture Development Programme (CAADP).  It will also  facilitate enhanced donor coordination in their support to activities  under CAADP and to African agriculture more broadly.</narrative>
  </description>
